#===============================================================
# THE FOLLOWING DIRECTIVES DETERMINE WHICH SCHEMA SHOULD BE USED
#===============================================================
#===============================================================================================================================================================================
# A DISCLOSURE group named MAP_FEATURES_GROUP must be created with macros FME_DISCLOSURE_OPEN%CATEGORIES_QUERY%HANDLE_MULTI OSM Map Features wherever this .fmi file is included
# Also ensure that CATEGORIES_QUERY, USER_CONFIG, USER_CONFIG_PATH, HANDLE_MULTI, and COMMUNITY_FEATURE_TYPES are listed at the top of the .fmf file as SOURCE_READER parameters
#===============================================================================================================================================================================
DEFAULT_MACRO OSM_IN_COMMUNITY_FEATURE_TYPES_OSM_2 MAPPED
OSM_2_COMMUNITY_FEATURE_TYPES "$(OSM_IN_COMMUNITY_FEATURE_TYPES_OSM_2)"
