OSM_2_DEF building   created_by                   xml_buffer   area                         xml_buffer   tag{}.k                      xml_buffer   tag{}.v                      xml_buffer   nd{}.ref                     xml_buffer   member{}.type                xml_buffer   member{}.ref                 xml_buffer   member{}.role                xml_buffer   osm_feature_type             xml_buffer   osm_theme                    xml_buffer   source                       xml_buffer   building:use:pl              xml_buffer   layer                        xml_buffer   military                     xml_buffer   denomination                 xml_buffer   ref:ruian:building           xml_buffer   building:ruian:type          xml_buffer   construction                 xml_buffer   fixme                        xml_buffer   tourism                      xml_buffer   ref:bag                      xml_buffer   source:date                  xml_buffer   religion                     xml_buffer   amenity                      xml_buffer   start_date                   xml_buffer   addr:housenumber             xml_buffer   addr:city                    xml_buffer   addr:postcode                xml_buffer   power                        xml_buffer   substation                   xml_buffer   building:usage:pl            xml_buffer   building:levels              xml_buffer   name                         xml_buffer   addr:street                  xml_buffer   height                       xml_buffer   building                     xml_buffer
