FFS_2_DEF ValidatedBuildings   OBJECTID                     int32   GlobalID                     buffer   OWNERNM1                     varchar(150)   OWNERNM2                     varchar(150)   PSTLADDRESS                  varchar(250)   PSTLCITY                     varchar(100)   PSTLPROV                     varchar(25)   INTSTATE                     varchar(5)   INTPSTLCD                    varchar(10)   COUNTRY                      varchar(100)   REPRESENT                    varchar(14)   STATUS                       varchar(9)   LASTUPDATE                   datetime   LASTEDITOR                   varchar(50)   POSTALCODE                   varchar(6)   _ValidationZones             varchar(100)   _ValidationAddress           varchar(100)
